{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Layouts","text":"Layouts"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component can be rendered as two different layouts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the component has a leading indicator, a label and optional helper texts, and an optional trailing decorative icon"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"inverse"}]},{"type":"text","text":": like the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":" layout but with a trailing checkbox indicator and a leading optional image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Indicator-states","text":"Indicator states"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The checkbox indicator has three available states:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"selected"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the checkbox is filled with a tick, the user has made the action to select the checkbox"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unselected"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the checkbox is empty, does not contain a tick, the user has made the action to unselect or did not select yet the checkbox"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": mike a prefilled or preticked checkbox, the user did not do anything on it yet"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need a checkbox with only two states to manage use instead ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Particular-cases","text":"Particular cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate"},{"text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A dedicated look and feel is implemented for that if the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"text":" flag is risen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In that case if the component displayed an icon, this icon will be replaced automatically by an error icon.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate"},{"text":" can be in read only mode, i.e. the user cannot interact with the component yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but this component must not be considered as disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component does not follow the right-to-left (RTL) \/ left-to-right (LTR) mode returned by the system as it could have some meaning","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to have for example the indicator in trailing position for LTR mode and vice versa.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, if the component has an icon in leading position (RTL mode) or in trailing position (LTR), the content of the icon is never changed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It could lead to a loss of meaning or semantics in the icon. Thus the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSImage"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flipped"},{"text":" property can be used to flip the icon content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whatever the layout direction is, preventing the user from implementing their own rules to flip or not the image.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a custom checkbox trait.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","text":"Forbidden by design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a read only component.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both a read only and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an indeterminate state checkbox","    @Published var selection: OUDSCheckboxIndicatorState = .indeterminate","","    \/\/ A leading checkbox with a label.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Hello world\", selection: $selection)","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(LocalizedStringKey(\"select_all\"), bundle: Bundle.module, selection: $selection)","","    \/\/ A leading checkbox with a label, but in read only mode.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Hello world\", selection: $selection, isReadOnly: true)","","    \/\/ A leading checkbox with a label and a description as helper text.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Bazinga!\", selection: $selection, description: \"Doll-Dagga Buzz-Buzz Ziggety-Zag\")","","    \/\/ A trailing checkbox with a label, an helper text and an icon (tinted, default rendering).","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"We live in a fabled world\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  description: \"Of dreaming boys and wide-eyed girls\",","                                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")),","                                  isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ A trailing checkbox with a raw (non-tinted) image.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"We live in a fabled world\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  description: \"Of dreaming boys and wide-eyed girls\",","                                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"il_someImage\"), renderingMode: .original),","                                  isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ Flip the icon for RTL layouts using OUDSImage.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Cocorico !\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","                                                   flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft),","                                  isReversed: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft)","","    \/\/ If on error, add an error message can help user to understand error context","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"We live in a fabled world\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  isError: true,","                                  errorText: .raw(\"Something wrong\"),","                                  hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ The error message is an OUDSTextualContent: raw, localized or rich text","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"We live in a fabled world\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  isError: true,","                                  errorText: .localized(\"error_wording\", bundle: Bundle.module))","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"We live in a fabled world\",","                                  selection: $selection,","                                  isError: true,","                                  errorText: .rich(AttributedString(markdown: \"You **must** select it\"))) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init","","    \/\/ A leading checkbox with a label, but disabled.","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Hello world\", selection: $selection)","        .disabled(true)","","    \/\/ Never disable a read only or an error-related checkbox as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Hello world\", selection: $selection, isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error","    OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate(\"Hello world\", selection: $selection, isReadOnly: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Rich-text","text":"Rich text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rich text can only be used for error messages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The error message is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent"},{"text":": a raw ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"text":", a localized string with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".localized(_:tableName:bundle:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a rich text with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rich(_:)"},{"text":" and an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Suggestions","text":"Suggestions"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"According to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-checkbox"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the checkbox by default must be used in unselected state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"text"}],"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"unified-design-system.orange.com","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-checkbox"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_checkboxItem_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_checkboxItem_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_checkboxItem_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_checkboxItem_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Version","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2.4.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.12.0","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminateV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","k